          "cont": [],
          "key": "description",
          "lead": [],
          "value": "\"`bsc rf` — DEFENSIVE RF monitoring: detect radio jamming and RF denial-of-service against 2.4/5 GHz WiFi from a commodity adapter. Reads the radio's own telemetry (nl80211 survey occupancy, monitor-mode radiotap frame statistics) and fuses several weak signals into a verdict that carries its evidence. Nothing here transmits — there is no injection, no deauth and no active probing path, and a test asserts it.\""
        }
